SUMMARY:UnERD 2026 – Undergraduate Engineering Research Day
DESCRIPTION:Mark your calendars – UnERD 2026 is taking place on Tuesday\, August 25\, 2026\, at Myhal Centre! \nWhat is UnERD? This is U of T Engineering’s annual conference where undergraduate students gather to present their research to a broad audience of peers\, faculty and industry professionals. UnERD aims to promote collaboration and networking\, as well as the exchange of innovative solutions across a wide breadth of global challenges. \nAll students\, professors\, and researchers are welcome to attend! Learn more about UnERD 2026. \nStay Connected\n\nEmail: unerd@engineering.utoronto.ca\nInstagram: @unerd_uoft \nLinkTree: U of T Undergraduate Engineering Research Day
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/unerd-2026-undergraduate-engineering-research-day/
LOCATION:Myhal Centre
CATEGORIES:Lectures, seminars and workshops
END:VEVENT
