SUMMARY:U of T Alumni Day at AFC Toronto - Soccer + CNE Access in One Ticket
DESCRIPTION:Make the most of your summer with a high-energy afternoon of soccer\, alumni connection\, and one of Toronto’s biggest seasonal attractions – all in a single ticket. \nJoin fellow U of T alumni\, family and friends at BMO Field as AFC Toronto takes on the Ottawa Rapid in Northern Super League action – Canada’s top tier of women’s professional soccer. \nYour Alumni Day ticket includes: \n\nDiscounted ticket pricing for reserved U of T alumni seats in Section 119\nAlumni shoutout on the stadium videoboard\nA U of T group photo on-site\nComplimentary general admission to the Canadian National Exhibition (CNE) – included with your match ticket\n\nWhy this even is a can’t miss:\nYour ticket doesn’t just get you into the match – it unlocks same-day admission to the CNE\, giving you access to rides\, games\, food vendors and entertainment across the grounds before or after kick-off. It’s a complete summer outing in one experience. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 30\, 2026\nLocation: BMO Field (170 Princes’ Blvd.\, Toronto\, ON\, M6K 3C3)\nGates Open: 3:00 p.m.\nKickoff: 4:00 p.m. \nTickets: $37\nAll sales are final. E-tickets will be distributed in advance of the event. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis event is presented in collaboration with University of Toronto partners\, including the Faculty of Applied Science & Engineering\, Faculty of Arts & Science\, Faculty of Kinesiology & Physical Education\, Henry N.R. Jackman Faculty of Law\, and Temerty Faculty of Medicine.
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/u-of-t-alumni-day-at-afc-toronto-soccer-cne-access-in-one-ticket/
LOCATION:BMO Field
CATEGORIES:Alumni events,Socials
END:VEVENT
