SUMMARY:U of T Engineering Orientation Week 2026
DESCRIPTION:Student Orientation | August 31 – September 4\, 2026\nAlso known as F!rosh Week\, Student Orientation Week is your (optional\, but encouraged) opportunity to participate in a wide variety of exciting student-run events organized by the Engineering Society\, designed to introduce you to the engineering community. \nAn Orientation Week ticket includes a F!rosh kit loaded with great swag\, along with access to a full lineup of events and food to keep you energized all week long. You’ll also receive a yearbook and a discounted ticket to Skule Nite\, a legendary comedy show created by engineering students. \nIf you can’t make it for the full week\, there will be faculty-organized events later in the week that are free for all incoming first-year students and do not require registration. \nGet ready to meet your classmates and make unforgettable memories. Stay tuned for more updates on Orientation Week!
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/u-of-t-engineering-orientation-week-2026/
CATEGORIES:Info sessions,Socials
END:VEVENT
