SUMMARY:Mentorship 101 - Become an alumni mentor!
DESCRIPTION:As a U of T Engineering alumni mentor\, you have the opportunity to guide a student toward new possibilities. Think of mentorship as a new soccer season: mentees are emerging talent and you are the coach who has played the game before. By joining the Alumni Mentorship Program (AMP)\, you’ll help students navigate their academic and career journeys—offering insights\, building confidence and making a lasting impact.  \n  Why join AMP?  \n\nGive back by helping develop the next generation of engineering talent. \n\n\nFlexible time commitment that fits your schedule \n\n\nOne-on-one or group mentoring—whatever fits your schedule \n\n\nExclusive events with fellow mentors and mentees \n\nStart your mentorship season on Thursday\, September 10 with Mentorship 101\, a virtual session that introduces the program\, outlines expectations and shares tips for a successful mentorship experience.  \nEvent Details:\nDate: Thursday\, September 10\, 2026\nTime: 6:00 p.m. – 6:45 p.m.\nLocation: Virtual\n \nRegister for the info session \nQuestions? \nEmail amp@engineering.utoronto.ca. 
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/mentorship-101-become-an-alumni-mentor-2/
LOCATION:Online
CATEGORIES:Info sessions
END:VEVENT
